    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A boss: base monster in the monster category, large (scale 1.5), with knockback resistance 1 and fire immunity. It hunts players and hits for 12 damage with a strong knockback (msm:attack). msm:boss_bar shows its health in a purple bar (10 notches) and darkens the sky for players nearby; a boss never despawns and is seen from ten chunks away. It never spawns on its own: summon it with its spawn egg or /summon. msm:animated_model names the model, animation set and texture with renderer auto: GeckoLib draws it where the target has GeckoLib, the runtime's own renderer elsewhere. Export the Fabric mod jar to try it in game."
